<article class="article" style="padding-top:48px">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose" style="margin:0">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you book a free consultation, we receive your name, your phone number or Telegram username, whether you are a student or a parent, the programme you are interested in, your preferred meeting type and language, and any question you write.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use this information only to contact you about your consultation and your study options at IIHE Cambodia. We do not sell it or share it with other organisations for marketing.</p>
      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep consultation requests for up to 24 months, then delete them, unless you enrol with us. If you enrol, your records become part of your student file.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us at any time to see, correct or delete the information you sent. Contact our admissions team using the details in the footer of this page.</p>
      <h2>Website services</h2>
      <p>This website is hosted by Netlify, which also receives form submissions on our behalf. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts. The site does not use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
      <p class="fine-print">Last updated October 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
